title    Jo-Ken-Pô!
composer Claude
about    Música de batalha. Chiptune acelerado, arpejos de onda quadrada e bateria eletrônica.
tempo    148
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.15

voice lead  chip     vol=0.8  pan=-0.1
voice lead2 saw      vol=0.55 pan=0.2 bright=0.8
voice arp   square   vol=0.35 pan=0.3 gate=0.6
voice bass  synbass  vol=0.9
voice kick  kick     vol=0.8
voice snare snare    vol=0.55 pan=0.05
voice hat   hat      vol=0.35 pan=0.3
voice crash crash    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2

pattern intro
arp   | E4 G4 B4 E5 B4 G4 E4 G4 B4 E5 B4 G4 E4 G4 B4 G4 | % |
bass  | E2- E2- E3- E2- E2- E2- E3- E2- | E2- E2- E3- E2- E2- E2- E3- B1- |
hat   | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | % |
snare | _ | o.o. o.o. xxxx XXXX |

